1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,340
Three weeks ago,

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:03,875
a girl I met at a goth night bit me.

3
00:00:04,025 --> 00:00:04,645
Last night,

4
00:00:04,695 --> 00:00:06,575
the council voted on my life.

5
00:00:06,625 --> 00:00:08,459
She voted to spare me.

6
00:00:08,529 --> 00:00:09,829
On one condition.

7
00:00:09,879 --> 00:00:11,079
By sunrise,

8
00:00:11,129 --> 00:00:14,219
the selfie I posted that night never happened.

9
00:00:14,289 --> 00:00:15,254
She wasn't in it.

10
00:00:15,304 --> 00:00:17,679
Three hundred and twelve people saw it.

11
00:00:17,909 --> 00:00:19,119
They handed me a list.

12
00:00:19,169 --> 00:00:20,199
Every viewer.

13
00:00:20,249 --> 00:00:21,848
In fountain pen.

14
00:00:21,917 --> 00:00:23,232
Number one,

15
00:00:23,282 --> 00:00:23,882
my mum.

16
00:00:23,932 --> 00:00:24,541
She'd liked it.

17
00:00:24,771 --> 00:00:26,231
She taught me on the walk home.

18
00:00:26,281 --> 00:00:27,406
Eye contact.

19
00:00:27,456 --> 00:00:28,206
Slowly.

20
00:00:28,256 --> 00:00:29,170
Forget.

21
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:30,141
First try,

22
00:00:30,191 --> 00:00:32,649
the pizza guy forgot his own name.

23
00:00:32,879 --> 00:00:34,624
By four a.m.,

24
00:00:34,674 --> 00:00:38,287
two hundred people had forgotten a photo of two glasses.

25
00:00:38,357 --> 00:00:39,317
And at every door,

26
00:00:39,367 --> 00:00:40,458
she said sorry.

27
00:00:40,508 --> 00:00:41,602
Sorry.

28
00:00:41,832 --> 00:00:44,801
Then I got to number three hundred and twelve.

29
00:00:44,951 --> 00:00:45,621
No name.

30
00:00:45,671 --> 00:00:46,711
No photo.

31
00:00:46,761 --> 00:00:49,659
The account was made the night I was bitten.

32
00:00:49,728 --> 00:00:51,548
They'd screenshotted my story.

33
00:00:51,598 --> 00:00:53,357
And sent one message.

34
00:00:53,508 --> 00:00:54,643
I know what she is.

35
00:00:54,693 --> 00:00:55,578
Do you?

36
00:00:55,967 --> 00:00:57,752
She read it over my shoulder.

37
00:00:57,802 --> 00:00:59,932
And stopped apologising.
